      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Cannot stress enough how big of an issue this is! Feels like insult to injury after WMR's software was announced to be depreciated.\n\nMenus are unusable by default & community fixes seem to not be able to fix gestures at all. Very unfortunate, it makes me realize how much I took this game's immersion for granted.",
